      "writtenOn": "2016-09-08T05:43:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, i is getting incremented by 1. But please notice \u0026__flash_lpfw_end means the 32-bits pointer of flash address. In this case, the size of lowpower_ram2 section is 60 bytes and (\u0026__flash_lplfw_end - \u0026__flash_lplfw_start) is 15.",
